[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // the file-descriptor level (dup/dup2 around the call) so that we see the exact
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // bytes glibc emitted for each library.
